<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>HEARTACHE</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Desire4u, whatsaheart</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">HEARTACHE</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2yEO4tULrEUBWHptP1KJOn</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.531" end="00:26.699">You tried to run away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.699" end="00:29.446">But I poisoned your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.446" end="00:31.381">You tried to escape</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.381" end="00:34.117">But lust makes you blind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.117" end="00:35.617">Don't try to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.313" end="00:36.813">Don't, don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.393" end="00:38.811">Don't try to run away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.811" end="00:40.311">Don't try to</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:39.999" end="00:41.499">Don't, don't</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.948" end="00:44.230">Don't try to run away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.230" end="00:45.765" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I'll catch you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.765" end="00:48.158">My love for you, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.158" end="00:50.634">It kills me to wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.634" end="00:53.010">No matter how far, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.010" end="00:54.976">You'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.976" end="00:58.114">You can run, you can hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.114" end="00:59.871">You'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.871" end="01:02.615">You can run, you can hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.615" end="01:04.842">You'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.842" end="01:06.660">Tell me, what is a heart?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.660" end="01:09.133">Can't keep it to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.133" end="01:11.645">I can't hide my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.645" end="01:13.750" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I can't hide my love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.750" end="01:16.142">I'll keep you to myself</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.142" end="01:18.762">You're all mine, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.762" end="01:20.580" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(You're all mine, my love)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.580" end="01:23.943">I'm creepin' into you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.943" end="01:26.335">My love for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.335" end="01:28.645">It kills me to wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.645" end="01:30.820">No matter how far, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:30.820" end="01:32.944">You'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.944" end="01:35.882">You can run, you can hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.882" end="01:37.553">You'll always be minе</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.553" end="01:40.046">You can run, you can hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.046" end="01:42.260">You'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.260" end="01:44.213">Don't bе scared, don't look back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.213" end="01:46.740">The music’s playin' too loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.740" end="01:48.997">I can't hear myself think</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.997" end="01:51.616">My thoughts are gone too loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.616" end="01:53.830">Don't be scared, don't look back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.830" end="01:55.924">The music’s playin' too loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.924" end="01:58.605">I can't hear myself think</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.605" end="02:00.105">My thoughts are gone too loud</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:59.650" end="02:01.728">My love for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.728" end="02:04.283">It kills me to wait</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.283" end="02:06.449">No matter how far, yeah</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.449" end="02:08.663">You'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.663" end="02:11.003">You can run, you can hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.003" end="02:13.291">You'll always be mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.291" end="02:15.818">You can run, you can hide</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.818" end="02:19.818">You'll always be mine</p></div></body></tt>